}, {
  "id": "doc_telepathy_and_mind_reading",
  "name": "Telepathy & Mind Reading",
  "type": "active",
  "class": "universal",
  "description": "The ability to communicate directly mind-to-mind and/or glean thoughts without spoken words. Telepathy can be one-way or two-way; for example, a wizard might project their voice into a friend\u2019s head from afar, or a creature like a telepathic alien might carry on a silent conversation with you. Detect Thoughts is a common mind-reading spell which lets the caster hear the surface thoughts of nearby creatures (often without them knowing). By concentrating, one can probe deeper to try to learn secrets, though the target may sense the intrusion and can resist with a save. Outside combat, telepathy is a fantastic tool for silent coordination (the party can plan ambushes or share info stealthily) and for understanding creatures that don\u2019t speak your language (if they have thoughts, you can read the general idea). Mind reading specifically can unravel mysteries \u2013 e.g., reading a suspect\u2019s thoughts to see if they\u2019re lying, or skimming a guarded diplomat\u2019s mind for the password to a door. It\u2019s non-combat because it doesn\u2019t damage or control the target, just reads or sends information.",
  "level": 1,
  "template": {
    "category": "Manipulation Abilities (Mental & Physical Manipulation)",
    "function": "manipulation",
    "elements": ["ice", "arcane"],
    "synergies": ["Telepathy pairs with Infiltration and Stealth \u2013 an invisible spy with telepathy can report everything they see in real-time to allies without needing noisy radios or coming back. Mind reading synergizes with Insight/Persuasion: you can detect what someone fears or wants, then tailor your negotiation exactly to that. It\u2019s also a counter to deception: if a foe claims \u201cI don\u2019t know where the princess is,\u201d a quick skim of their thoughts might reveal an image of the hidden cell. A fun synergy is with Illusion: you can project a telepathic illusion of someone\u2019s own voice or thought, making them think an idea came to them internally (basically Inception-lite). Also, if you have Memory alteration, you could use mind reading to find a memory then tweak it. Telepathy is a cornerstone of many non-combat strategies due to its unparalleled communication advantage."],
    "source": "docx_non_combat_abilities_spells"
  },
